  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「ふむ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「さすがです、転校生さん。花鳥園の園内放送で『迷子のお知らせ』をしてもらうとは……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「まったく思いつきませんでした」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「これで、うまくいけば冴木先輩と合流できますね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「花鳥園の職員のかたも、捜索を手伝ってくれるようですし」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「ついでに、偽物の冴木先輩もコインロッカーに預けられましたしね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「冴木先輩が小柄で助かりました、ちょうどいいサイズでした」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「とはいえ、冴木先輩は自分の意志でどっか行っちゃったわけで。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「呼びだしに応じてくれるかは、びみょうなところです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「それに冴木先輩は、絵を描くことに集中すると周りの音や声にまったく反応しなくなってしまうので。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「放送が、聞こえなかった可能性もあるでしょう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「やや面倒ですが、地道に歩いて探すしかないでしょうね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「人探しは、人数がおおいほうが効率的です。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「できれば、転校生さんにも手伝ってほしいところですけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「そこまで、甘えてしまうわけにはいきませんよね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「えっ、よろしいのですか？　助かります……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「ふむ、ふむ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「転校生さんは、三波先輩の代理として、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「わたしたち美術部の『保護者』となるべく花鳥園にきたのですね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「三波先輩に、頼まれて……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「三波先輩は、お身体の具合でもよろしくないのでしょうか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「そうですか、また風邪をひかれたのですか。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「三波先輩、健康的に見えるのに、意外とよく体調を崩されますよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「自分が風邪ぎみなのに、わたしたちのことを気にかけているのが、三波先輩らしいですけど……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「そうですか、それならお言葉に甘えましょう。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「転校生さんには三波先輩の代理として、たっぷりわたしたちを甘やかしていただきます♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「しかし、失敬な話ではありますね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 22,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すみれ",
    "text": "「自由すぎる冴木先輩はともかく、わたしは『保護者』が必要な間抜けではないのですけど……？」"
